WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.889
Well there he is folks! The future of the
New York Knicks.

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:12.309
What--who, that guy?
Yeah, the rookie… “What’s His Name.”

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:17.260
Uhh.. Chris Taps Poor Jangis.
No it’s KRISTAPS PORZINGIS, and he SUCKS.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:21.420
He sucks? Then why’d we draft him?
Because he doesn’t suck, okay? He’s supposed

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.090
to be the Latvian Dirk Nowitzki.
Not according to Phil Jackson.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.830
Yeah, Phil who thinks this kid’s gonna be
the next Shawn Bradley!

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.740
But he drafted ‘em!
Yeah and we won’t even know for years!

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.900
That’s right, they say he’s two to three
years away at best.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.570
You gotta let ‘em develop!
Two to three years until what? Until we find

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.820
out he’s Shawn Bradley?
Two to three years until he’s STILL two

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.480
to three years away.
Two to three years is FOREVER!

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.740
HE COULD BE DEAD BY THE TIME HE’S GOOD!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.460
Porzingis! Porzingis!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:49.680
Is he the Latvian Dirk?
Or Latvian Shawn?

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:55.260
Porzingis Porzingis! Is he the Latvian Dirk?

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.710
Yeah, no way. This kid is the Latvian Shawn
Bradley. I’m tellin’ ya.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:01.649
No, this guy’s got a much higher ceiling.
Chyeah and a much lower floor.

00:01:01.649 --> 00:01:03.899
Woah woah woah, how low are we talkin’ about
here?

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:05.780
Like, below sea level.
Like bottomless pit!

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.020
He’s too skinny.
He’s too frickin white if you ask me.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.680
He’s too skinny and white!

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:17.380
Porzingis! Porzingis! Is he the Latvian Dirk?
Or Latvian Shawn?

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:22.920
Porzingis Porzingis! Is he the Latvian Dirk?

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.320
No, he’s the Latvian Shawn!

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.320
No, he’s the Latvian Dirk!

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.080
Shawn!

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:28.580
Dirk!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.140
Shawn!

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:29.640
Dirk!

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:37.780
Well maybe we should wait and see.
What young Kristaps turns out to be.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:46.460
Labels like Dirk and Shawn are a burden.
Plus, he’s obviously the next Patrick Ewing!

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:53.520
Porzingis! Porzingis! Is he the Latvian Dirk?
Or Latvian Shawn?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.679
Porzingis Porzingis! Is he the Latvian Dirk?

00:01:58.679 --> 00:02:01.839
Well I guess all we can do is what to see
if this guy turns out to be Dirk!

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:08.220
Or Shawn!
Or Dirk!

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.680
Or Shawn!

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.500
Or Patrick Ewing.

